+The automatic feature Preview for commit `480ac243` stopped at frozen dependency installation: pnpm 11.9.0 reported `ERR_PNPM_IGNORED_BUILDS` for `core-js@3.47.0`. An isolated install with an empty store, no project environment files and no project credentials reproduced that exact failure after Prisma generation. pnpm added an unresolved policy placeholder to its local workspace file during that failed install; that generated state remains only in the local diagnostic receipts.
